direction: right
title: |md
  # Build and release pipeline
| {near: top-center}

push: |md
  **Push or pull request**

  to main
| {shape: rectangle; class: actor}
checks: "Checks, in parallel" {
  class: group
  test: |md
    **Test**

    lint, types,

    tests, coverage
  | {shape: rectangle; class: box}
  scan: |md
    **Image scan**

    build the image,

    Trivy scan
  | {shape: rectangle; class: box}
}
gate: |md
  **Release gate**

  both pass, and

  a push to main
| {shape: rectangle; class: key}
publish: |md
  **Build and publish**

  image tagged by commit,

  to Docker Hub and Azure

  Container Registry
| {shape: rectangle; class: box}
app: |md
  **Azure App Service**

  runs that

  commit's image
| {shape: rectangle; class: good}
push -> checks.test
push -> checks.scan
checks.test -> gate
checks.scan -> gate
gate -> publish
publish -> app
